{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果下一代iPhone的設計細節再次提前曝光。網絡上出現了疑似iPhone Air 2和標準版iPhone 18的金屬模型機，展示了兩款新機可能採用的外觀設計。其中最值得關注的變化是，iPhone Air 2終於有望擺脱單攝像頭配置，增加第二顆後置攝像頭。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585826.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T15:02:16.763017+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T14:49:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T14:55:39.623274+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T14:55:39.623274+00:00","content_hash":"27c04565d3cdfa5fea43b449295a922324dc44b06aaeea3f77e82caabb41e30b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}